pi-pstack
=========

This package is a native Pi coding-agent port of the Cursor plugin "pstack"
(https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack), originally authored by
Lauren Tan (poteto). Upstream license: MIT. Upstream version: pstack v0.15.2.

Philosophy, playbooks, and principle skills are preserved. The Pi host surface
is the official subagent, slash, and todo extensions, plus skills that call
those primitives. Model routing is an always-applied block in
~/.pi/agent/AGENTS.md written by /setup-pstack.

Built against official Pi package/extension APIs (@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent).
